Package: DataCleanR
Title: Data Cleaning Pipelines for Salary Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Loïc", "Mémeteau", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Arthur", "Hauguel", role = "aut"),
    person("Margot", "Laignel", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Helpers and orchestrated pipelines to validate schemas, standardise
    column names, enforce types, deduplicate rows, impute missing values,
    winsorise salary outliers, normalise categorical values, convert currencies
    to USD, and export cleaned salary data with optional reports.
